<h2>RETURNS AND REFUNDS</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Your satisfaction is our priority and we stand behind all the parts we sell as part of our quality guarantee!</li>
  <li>We offer a 60 day return period for all our items. 60 day return period begins on the day the part is delivered.</li>
  <li>We test and ensure each part we sell is in good working order. However, if you receive the part and it is damaged, not functioning correctly or if we missed something, please reach out as soon as possible so we can remedy the situation.</li>
  <li>We are NOT responsible for paint code mismatches. We cannot guarantee any color to match your vehicle or part to specification as any panel/part could have been altered due to weather, repainting, or alterations from the manufacturer. Therefore, no REFUNDS will be issued for paint issues and mismatches.</li>
  <li>Items purchased and returned due to no fault of ours can incur a restocking fee and original shipping cost will not be refunded. This includes but is not limited to the following reasons: “found better price”, “didn't like it”, “does not fit”, “ordered by mistake”, and “changed my mind.” If the returned item is received damaged or not in original condition we will charge up to a 50% restocking fee.</li>
  <li>All items have an identifier made by us and will be inspected once received by our shipping department. Only items with this identifier will be processed for a refund.</li>
  <li>If the part is damaged during the shipping process, in order for us to file a damage claim you will be asked to provide proof that the carrier is at fault.</li>
  <li>We are not responsible for installation errors, labor expenses and/or any other expenses that you may incur.</li>
  <li>No returns on international orders.</li>
  <li>Any special-order items such as body cuts, frame cuts, etc. are final sale. No refunds will be issued.</li>
</ul>
